  "app_review_info": {
    "notes": "Thank you for reviewing Pausely.\n\nSign in with the review account in the App Review Information fields, or with Sign in with Apple.\n\nWHAT TO TRY\n1. Add a subscription from the catalog (+ button). Pausely then offers to turn on renewal reminders.\n2. Open a subscription that renews within 3 days to see the Renewal Verdict (keep it or cancel it). Tapping a reminder opens the same screen.\n3. Cancel one with \"I cancelled it\": it stays in the list as cancelled and appears on the Savings Receipt (Profile > Savings Receipt).\n4. Pausely Pro is an auto-renewing subscription: $4.99/month or $29.99/year, with a 7-day free trial. It unlocks unlimited subscriptions, Pause Plan (Analysis tab), savings analysis and cheaper alternatives. Restore Purchases is on the paywall. Reminders, Renewal Verdicts, cancel help and the Savings Receipt are free.\n5. Account deletion: Profile > Privacy & Security > Delete Account. It deletes the account and its data from our servers and from the device.\n\nPausely does not cancel subscriptions for anyone; it shows the steps and links to each service's own cancellation page. Gmail import is turned off in this build.\n\nContact: pausely@proton.me",
